abstract: >
  MouseScope is a modular desktop platform for practical mouse behavioral
  video analysis. Version 2.1.0 supports Tail Suspension Test (TST), Open
  Field Test (OFT), Novel Object Recognition (NOR), Elevated Plus Maze
  (EPM), and Y-Maze in one unified workflow with visual setup, batch
  workspace, result export, and bilingual reporting.
